<div class="flex-1">
  <%= render "shared/header" %>

  <main>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="lg:flex items-center my-6">
        <h1 class="flex-1 mb-1 text-2xl font-bold leading-7 text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl sm:truncate lg:mb-0">
          <%= "About #{ENV["SITE_NAME"]}" %>
        </h1>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-base text-gray-900">Orange <em>should</em> be a hard color to miss.</p>
        <p>
          Just ask Nickelodeon, Home Depot, or the Sun.
          But when neon orange <strong>TH</strong> flyers are tied to every tree on your block, they have a way of blending in with nature.
          And as every long-time Chicagoan with a car knows, there may come a time when you don't notice those <strong>TH</strong> flyers until it's too late and the City's already left a $60 neon orange "reminder" under your windshield wiper.
        </p>
        <p>
          <%= link_to 'However you feel', 'https://chicagoreader.com/news-politics/why-sweep-the-streets/', class: 'underline', target: '_blank', rel: "nofollow noopener noreferrer" %> about street sweeping, <%= "<b>".html_safe + ENV["SITE_NAME"] + "</b>".html_safe %> is here to help you avoid getting ticketed.
          Just enter your street address, and we'll use the sanitation schedule from the City of Chicago's <%= link_to "open data portal", 'https://data.cityofchicago.org/browse?category=Sanitation', class: 'underline', target: '_blank', rel: "nofollow noopener noreferrer" %> to let you know when your street is due for cleaning.
          And, if you want reminders down the road, sign up for email notifications or download the schedule as an iCalendar (.ics) file.
        </p>
        <p>
          <%= "<b>".html_safe + ENV["SITE_NAME"] + "</b>".html_safe %> (formerly SweepAround.Us) was created in 2011 by Scott Robbin and is currently maintained by <%= link_to "Carl Hauck", "https://www.instagram.com/carlhauck/", class: "underline", target: "_blank", rel: "nofollow noopener noreferrer" %> and Kat Evans.
          None of them work for the City.
          All three have received their fair share of street sweeping tickets.
          (In other words, please direct your appeals elsewhere.)
        </p>
        <p>
          Lastly, if you find this site helpful and want to help with the cost of running it, <%= link_to 'send us a few bucks', coffee_link_url, class: 'underline', target: '_blank', rel: "nofollow noopener noreferrer" %>.
          (Full technical disclosure: Heroku + Postgres + Redis + dyno + domain name + Google Maps + SendGrid expenses all add up to an annual sum equal to 10+ street sweeping tickets).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
          Have a question or suggestion?
          Drop us a line at <a href="mailto:info@wethesweeple.com" class="underline">info@wethesweeple.com</a>.
        </p>
        <%= render "shared/buy_us_a_coffee_button" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</div>
